Four editor screens are ready at **1664 × 936**, exactly 16:9.

1. [Hockey interview](docs/shifts/2026-11-19-night/lanes/editor/mockups/01-match-length.png) keeps the player’s sentence visible while they accept, adjust, or defer the Foreman’s suggested three 36-second periods.
2. [Plot placement](docs/shifts/2026-11-19-night/lanes/editor/mockups/02-road-clearance.png) shows the rink and stands against a 2 m walker, the neighbouring kart track, and the gate. Red hatching marks where the rink crosses the road, and **Centre on plot** offers a fix.
3. [Build in progress](docs/shifts/2026-11-19-night/lanes/editor/mockups/03-build-site.png) shows the finished rink, skaters under test, and the stands crew waiting for an answer. The crew explains why the north side would keep the gate clear.
4. [Arena RPG interview](docs/shifts/2026-11-19-night/lanes/editor/mockups/04-arena-idea.png) explains why no recipe fits and asks the player what should trigger the next wave.

[Design notes](docs/shifts/2026-11-19-night/lanes/editor/mockups/NOTES.md) accompany the screens. The [mockups folder](docs/shifts/2026-11-19-night/lanes/editor/mockups/) contains all five raw ImageGen outputs, including the first placement attempt, and the verified exact prompt for every image.
